 <details class="supplementary"><summary>补充企业事实与必要澄清 · 合成数据</summary><section><h2>三项事实与必要澄清</h2><p>仅合成数据。自述和文档摘录都是未核实来源，候选不代表资格通过。</p><form id="candidate-intake"><label>地区<input id="candidate-region" maxlength="2000"></label><label>员工人数<input id="candidate-employees" type="number" min="0" step="1"></label><label>服务诉求<input id="candidate-service_need" maxlength="2000"></label><button>评审三项候选</button></form><button id="review">集中查看必要问题</button><form id="clarifications" hidden><div id="questions"></div><label>补充自述的来源版本<input id="answer-version" value="1" maxlength="40" required></label><button>提交补充自述</button><button id="cancel-clarification" type="button">取消本次补充</button><small>补充后重新评审，旧来源和历史保留；仍需授权核查。</small></form></section></details>
 <section id="resource" hidden><p class="eyebrow">RESOURCES · 资源</p><h2>为下一步安排资源</h2><p class="subtitle">查看可用区间，短期占位，再显式核对本地合成确认。</p><div class="steps" aria-label="资源办理步骤"><span><b>01</b>预检区间</span><span><b>02</b>短期占位</span><span><b>03</b>本地确认</span></div><p class="notice">仅用于本机合成测试。预检不保证后续占位；有效占位可显式本地合成确认；不代表真实预约，外部未受理，无线下履约。确认保留区间容量，取消可释放。两个占位之间的前后缓冲均计入容量冲突。</p><button id="resource-catalog">查看有权使用的合成资源</button><div id="resource-catalog-view"></div><form id="resource-form" hidden><label>合成资源<select id="resource-select" required></select></label><label>开始时间（UTC）<input id="resource-start" type="datetime-local" required></label><label>结束时间（UTC）<input id="resource-end" type="datetime-local" required></label><label>使用份数<input id="resource-quantity" type="number" min="1" max="20" step="1" value="1" required></label><label>短期占位有效秒数（5—300）<input id="resource-ttl" type="number" min="5" max="300" step="1" value="120" required></label><label>合成使用说明<input id="resource-purpose" maxlength="200" required></label><div class="actions"><button id="resource-preview" type="button">预检当前区间</button><button id="resource-hold" disabled>创建短期占位</button></div><fieldset><legend>查找同一资源的替代时段</legend><p>保留上方时长和份数。窗口最多24小时，以窗口起点每15分钟检查，最多100个候选，返回最早10个；仅覆盖所查网格。建议不占位，也不保证之后仍有容量。</p><label>搜索窗口起点（UTC）<input id="resource-search-from" type="datetime-local"></label><label>搜索窗口终点（UTC）<input id="resource-search-until" type="datetime-local"></label><button id="resource-alternatives" type="button">查找替代时段</button><div id="resource-alternative-results" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div></fieldset></form><p id="resource-preview-result" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="resource-current"></div><button id="resource-mine">刷新我的占位记录</button><p>状态以本次刷新为准。过期不依赖清理任务；刷新可核对已经发送的占位，不能靠切换页面撤回。</p><div id="resource-hold-items"></div><div class="combination-panel"><h3>两资源合成组合</h3><p class="subtitle">先分别预检并占位，再在本人记录中选取两个不同资源。两条都有效才一起确认；失败不会部分确认，原占位仍按各自期限计时。</p><p id="combination-selection" aria-live="polite">已选 0 / 2 条占位</p><div class="actions"><button id="combination-confirm" disabled>确认这两个合成资源</button><button id="combination-mine" type="button" class="secondary">刷新我的组合记录</button></div><p id="combination-feedback" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><section id="bundle-panel" class="combination-panel"><h3>多会话资源组合</h3><p>选择3–8条本人已有占位，一次核对并确认全部容量；可以包含同一合成资源的不同时段。</p><button id="bundle-confirm" disabled>明确确认这组占位</button><button id="bundle-mine" class="secondary">查看我的多会话组合</button><button id="bundle-recover" class="secondary">只读核对原组合操作</button><p id="bundle-status" role="status"></p><p id="bundle-error" role="alert"></p></section><section id="delivery-panel" class="combination-panel"><h3>交付到此Case</h3><p>选择3–8条本人已有占位，核对当前资料、服务与已采用计划，再一次提交全部容量和首次Case关联。</p><label>Case资料事项编号<input id="delivery-case" maxlength="36" autocomplete="off"></label><label id="delivery-reapproval-option" hidden><input id="delivery-reapproval" type="checkbox" disabled>来源变化后重新批准并交付替代资源</label><label id="delivery-plan-replacement-option" hidden><input id="delivery-plan-replacement" type="checkbox" disabled>整计划替换后重新批准并续办此Case资源</label><label id="delivery-frontier-option" hidden><input id="delivery-frontier" type="checkbox" disabled>请求按原完整协议核对旧 P1/P2 已核验、P3–P5 尚未启动的有限资格</label><label id="delivery-p3-closure-option" hidden><input id="delivery-p3-closure" type="checkbox" disabled>请求核对原 P3 完整历史从未接单、已明确拒绝或撤回的收束资格</label><p>资格请求不是事实或批准；缺少原签发标记、完整历史或当前核对时不能接续。</p><p>仅原完整分派历史从未 ACCEPT 且已 DECLINED 或 WITHDRAWN 时可核对此资格。仍为 OFFERED 的分派须由原有权身份在原分派入口明确 WITHDRAW；本选项不会收束或撤回，也不是事实或授权。仍须原新计划 ADOPT、P1 核验及新方案明确批准。旧占用及全部历史保留，不自动释放。</p><p>重新批准保留旧资源占用和历史；整计划替换须先明确采纳新计划，再对新计划及本次容量重新批准。新容量及关联在明确批准后一起提交。</p><button id="delivery-preview">只读预检此Case交付</button><button id="delivery-confirm" disabled>明确交付到此Case</button><button id="delivery-recover" class="secondary">只读核对原Case交付</button><div id="delivery-result" role="status"></div><p id="delivery-error" role="alert"></p><section id="plan-approval-panel" hidden><h3>此方案的合成批准</h3><p>只批准原企业经办人对此Case的精确首次资源交付。来源、授权或期限变化须重新提出和批准；撤销批准不会取消已有实际记录。</p><div class="actions"><button id="plan-approval-read" class="secondary">读取此Case批准历史</button><button id="plan-approval-propose" disabled>明确提出此交付方案</button><button id="plan-approval-approve" disabled>明确批准此方案</button><button id="plan-approval-revoke" disabled class="secondary">明确撤销此批准</button><button id="plan-approval-recover" class="secondary">只读核对原批准操作</button></div><div id="plan-approval-result" role="status"></div><p id="plan-approval-error" role="alert"></p></section></section><div id="combination-items"></div></div><p id="resource-error" role="alert"></p></section>
 <section id="prep-detail" hidden><section id="objection-panel"><h3>资料交付异议与企业复核</h3><p>只处理本事项合成资料交付；专员回应后由企业明确复核，Case目标仍未完成。</p><p id="objection-status" role="status"></p><div id="objection-items"></div><label>异议、回应或复核说明<textarea id="objection-reason" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><button id="objection-raise" type="button">提出资料交付异议</button><button id="objection-recover" type="button" hidden>只读核对原异议操作</button><p id="objection-error" role="alert"></p></section>
-<p class="eyebrow">PREPARATION · 资料准备</p><h2>资料准备事项</h2><p id="prep-summary" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><section id="ordinary-runtime-entry" class="combination-panel"><h3>此事项的原运行与办理入口</h3><p>按当前资料记录的 Case、Run 和精确服务版本读取；各入口仍会核对当前权限。已有访问批准只用于原 Run READ，资源方案批准仍须原独立契约。</p><button id="runtime-run-read" type="button">只读查看此事项原 Run</button><button id="runtime-dispatch-read" type="button">进入此事项原分派与接单</button><button id="runtime-access-read" type="button">只读查看原 Run 访问批准</button><button id="runtime-catalog-read" type="button">读取精确目录与方案批准状态</button><p id="runtime-entry-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="runtime-catalog-result"></div><section id="resource-plan-approval-read-panel"><h3>资源方案批准 · 只读核对已有记录</h3><p>与 Run READ 访问批准分开核对。这里不创建或激活批准，也不提供资源执行权限。</p><button id="resource-plan-approval-read" type="button">读取已有资源方案批准</button><p id="resource-plan-approval-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="resource-plan-approval-result"></div><button id="resource-plan-approval-original" type="button" hidden>只读核对原批准记录</button></section></section><button id="prep-refresh">刷新当前事项</button><section id="case-cancel-panel" class="combination-panel"><h3>未提交回执前取消</h3><p>仅支持普通合成Case：首次接单前，或已接单且全部人工步骤从未提交回执。已有提交、核对、关闭或隔离效果均不能在此取消。取消停止新增资料、方案、分派、接单和回执；成功建单、原资料与实际接单历史保留。本片不支持取消后恢复。取消不释放预约，已有预约仍占容量，请按原资源权限独立释放。</p><button id="case-cancel-read" type="button" class="secondary">核对取消条件与原请求</button><button id="case-cancel-recover" type="button" class="secondary" hidden>只读核对原取消</button><p id="case-cancel-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="case-cancel-new-entry" hidden><h4>用新输入另建独立事项</h4><p>此旧Case仍为CANCELLED，原资料、接单历史、责任和资源占用保留。新Case须填写全新诉求与材料，另行采用方案、审批、核对容量及办理。已有资源仅可从原入口独立授权释放。</p><label><input id="case-cancel-new-confirm" type="checkbox">我确认前往原新事项入口，使用全新输入另建独立Case；不恢复旧Case，不带入原方案、审批或资源，也不自动释放占用。</label><button id="case-cancel-new-open" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>前往新事项输入入口</button></div><form id="case-cancel-form" hidden><label>明确取消原因<textarea id="case-cancel-reason" required maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><label><input id="case-cancel-confirm" type="checkbox">我确认取消此Case，并理解预约须独立释放且本片不支持恢复</label><button id="case-cancel-submit" type="submit" disabled>确认取消此Case</button></form></section><section id="case-reconcile-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>已有人工回执：取消请求与核对</h3><p>仅用于无外部效果的本地人工合成回执。请求后停止新的办理，原回执事实与预约保留；未明确结果继续核对中。全部原结果核实后仍须单独确认终结。取消不会释放预约，资源须按原权限独立办理。</p><button id="case-reconcile-read" type="button" class="secondary">读取当前取消与全部原回执</button><button id="case-reconcile-recover" type="button" class="secondary" hidden>只读核对原请求结果</button><p id="case-reconcile-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="case-reconcile-receipts"></div><form id="case-reconcile-form" hidden><label>本次明确操作原因<textarea id="case-reconcile-reason" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><label><input id="case-reconcile-confirm" type="checkbox" required>本人已核对当前Case及全部原资料；明确选择本次操作，保留原事实，资源另行释放</label><div class="actions"><button id="case-reconcile-request" type="button" disabled>明确请求取消，停止新办理</button><button id="case-reconcile-record" type="button" disabled>保存逐项核对结果</button><button id="case-reconcile-finish" type="button" disabled>全部结果核实后确认终结</button></div></form></section><section id="handling-deadline-panel" class="combination-panel"><h3>办理期限与来源</h3><p>核对当前事项的明确来源与逐日工作日历。缺少来源时保持待确认；当前没有业务停表权限。</p><button id="handling-deadline-read" type="button" class="secondary">只读核对办理期限</button><p id="handling-deadline-status" role="status">办理期限待确认。</p><div id="handling-deadline-result"></div><p id="handling-deadline-error" role="alert"></p></section><p id="prep-recovery-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="prep-recovery-read" class="secondary" hidden>只读核对此事项原提交记录</button><button id="prep-recovery-release" class="secondary" hidden>已查看当前材料，返回原流程</button><div id="prep-materials"></div><section id="material-draft-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>从已选事实整理诉求摘要</h3><p>将你为本事项明确选用的地区、员工人数和服务诉求整理成新的未核验材料，交给原获派专员检查。不会生成政策要求、证明或资格结论，也不会自动补齐材料目录。</p><button id="material-draft-read" type="button" class="secondary">查看当前来源的摘要草稿与待补材料</button><p id="material-draft-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="material-draft-content"></div><div id="material-draft-checklist"></div><form id="material-draft-form" hidden><label><input id="material-draft-share" type="checkbox" required>我已检查全文，明确将这三个所选自述值及来源版本/指纹作为本事项的新材料分享给下方原获派专员；仍须其独立核对</label><p id="material-draft-recipient"></p><button id="material-draft-save">明确追加此摘要为新未核验版本</button></form><p id="material-draft-error" role="alert"></p></section><section id="material-file-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>从文件整理材料候选</h3><p>选择本人有权使用的本地合成样例 TXT、MD、CSV 或 JSON。最多8KiB，整理后的正文最多4000字符；只读取你选择的文件，不提取事实或核实真实性，不调用模型。文件内容会发送到当前本机API解析，先看全文再决定是否填入原表单。</p><label>合成样例文件<input id="material-file-input" type="file" accept=".txt,.md,.csv,.json"></label><label><input id="material-file-synthetic" type="checkbox">这是我有权用于此事项的合成样例，内容不代表真实企业资料或业务证明</label><button id="material-file-read" type="button">读取文件并查看候选全文</button><p id="material-file-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="material-file-output" hidden><label>候选正文（尚未保存）<textarea id="material-file-text" rows="8" readonly></textarea></label><p id="material-file-source"></p><button id="material-file-use" type="button" disabled>填入下方原材料表单</button><p>填入后可以人工编辑。原文件指纹仅作来源线索，本次保存以原表单正文为准；仍须点击原“追加材料版本”，再由原获派专员核对、企业确认。</p></div></section><section id="material-version-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>追加前核对本次材料差异</h3><p>先在下方原表单选择材料类型、填写或导入正文及来源，再核对同事项当前同槽材料。编辑后须重新核对；不会自动采纳事实、保存材料或解决补正。</p><button id="material-version-compare" type="button" class="secondary">核对本表单与当前材料差异</button><p id="material-version-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="material-version-output" hidden></div></section><form id="prep-evidence"><label>材料类型<select id="prep-slot"><option value="need_summary">诉求摘要</option><option value="material_outline">材料目录</option></select></label><label>候选材料内容<textarea id="prep-text" maxlength="4000" required></textarea></label><p id="material-file-editing" role="status" hidden></p><label>来源类型<select id="prep-source-kind"><option value="USER_STATEMENT">企业自述</option><option value="DOCUMENT_EXCERPT">文档摘录（尚未核实真实性）</option></select></label><label>来源与文档版本<input id="prep-source-label" maxlength="200" required placeholder="例如：合成材料清单 v1 / 用户自述"></label><button>追加材料版本</button></form><form id="prep-decision"><label>人工说明<textarea id="prep-reason" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><fieldset id="prep-correction-slots" hidden><legend>要求新版补正的材料</legend><label><input type="checkbox" data-correction-slot="need_summary">诉求摘要</label><label><input type="checkbox" data-correction-slot="material_outline">材料目录</label><p>所选材料须提交新版本后才能核对；未选择时只记录一般补正说明。</p></fieldset><div class="actions"><button id="prep-correction" type="button">要求补正</button><button id="prep-review" type="button">核对本地资料包</button><button id="prep-confirm" type="button">确认本地资料准备</button><button id="prep-reopen" type="button">申请重开资料准备</button></div></form><p>核对仅表示获派专员检查当前资料包，不证明资料真实性或资格满足。确认只推进本地资料准备；Case目标、外部受理和线下履约不自动完成。</p><button id="service-plan-prepare" class="secondary">查看此Case持久步骤计划</button><button id="plan-prepare" class="secondary">查看此事项四步计划</button><button id="local-case-prepare" class="secondary">查看此Case的本地关闭与重开记录</button><button id="dispatch-prepare" class="secondary">查看此事项的内部分派</button><button id="receipt-prepare" class="secondary" hidden>查看此运行已有获派执行者</button><form id="receipt-create" hidden><label>当前合法获派执行者<select id="receipt-executor" required></select></label><button>建立合成回执步骤</button></form><div class="combination-panel"><h3>此服务Case的资源关联</h3><p>选择本人已确认的组合，持久记录资料版本、资源归属和核对说明。关联不新增占用，不代表真实预约或履约；资料重开或资源变化须重新核对。</p><button id="case-resource-load" class="secondary" hidden>查看此Case资源并选择关联</button><div id="case-resource-panel" hidden><p id="case-resource-summary" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><form id="case-resource-form"><label>有权使用的资源组合<select id="case-resource-choice" required></select></label><label>关联或重新核对说明<textarea id="case-resource-reason" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><button>确认此Case资源关联</button></form><p class="notice">一个组合只归属一个Case。换组合或重开资料不会取消旧预约；到资源工作区显式整组取消，原关联历史保留。</p><div id="case-resource-history"></div></div><p id="case-resource-error" role="alert"></p></div><article id="simulation-rule-panel"><h3>合成规则准备度（开发模拟）</h3><p>仅定位服务端已配置的开发绑定。SYNTHETIC_REVIEWED只表示合成模拟事件链，不能代替正式审核或真实事实核验。资格始终未判定。</p><label>已有开发绑定编号<input id="simulation-binding" maxlength="100"></label><label>明确评估时点（UTC）<input id="simulation-as-of" type="datetime-local"></label><button id="simulation-rule-read" type="button" class="secondary">只读核对合成规则准备度</button><p id="simulation-rule-status" role="status"></p><div id="simulation-rule-result"></div></article><article id="case-time-panel"><h3>本人同资源替代时段</h3><p>先读取本事项当前办理计划和原资源关联，再查同一组资源的时段。提议不释放旧占用；分别预检、占位、组合确认、Case比较与重核仍须原入口明确操作。</p><label>搜索起点（UTC）<input id="case-time-from" type="datetime-local"></label><label>搜索终点（UTC，窗口不超过24小时）<input id="case-time-until" type="datetime-local"></label><button id="case-time-read" type="button" class="secondary">只读查找本人同资源替代时段</button><p id="case-time-status" role="status"></p><div id="case-time-result"></div><h4>仅GET核对原资源请求</h4><label>原请求类型<select id="case-resource-recovery-kind"><option value="HOLD">单资源占位/确认/释放</option><option value="COMBINATION">两资源组合确认/取消</option><option value="LINK">本事项资源关联</option></select></label><label>原请求键<input id="case-resource-recovery-key" maxlength="100"></label><label>原正文指纹（可选，精确64位SHA256）<input id="case-resource-recovery-fingerprint" maxlength="64"></label><button id="case-resource-recovery-read" type="button" class="secondary">只读核对这个原请求键</button><div id="case-resource-recovery-result"></div></article><div id="readiness-panel" class="combination-panel"><h3>此事项材料准备度</h3><p id="readiness-summary" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p>只核对本地合成资料条件。材料真实性未核实；规则处于工程草稿、未业务发布，资格仍未知，Case目标未完成。</p><button id="readiness-assess">保存当前材料准备度评估</button><section id="material-pack-panel"><h4>当前材料准备与补正文本包</h4><p>整理已分享的当前材料、缺口和原补正说明，供你复制或保存。每次输出重新核对权限与版本；正式政策和真实履约仍待核实。</p><button id="material-pack-generate" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>生成当前材料文本包</button><p id="material-pack-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="material-pack-output" hidden><label>本次读取快照<textarea id="material-pack-text" rows="12" readonly></textarea></label><button id="material-pack-copy" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>重新核对并复制</button><button id="material-pack-download" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>重新核对并下载文本</button></div></section><div id="readiness-checklist"></div><div id="readiness-conditions"></div><details><summary>可复核来源与规则</summary><div id="readiness-sources"></div></details><details><summary>历史评估（过期结论不能用于当前资料）</summary><div id="readiness-history"></div></details><p id="readiness-error" role="alert"></p></div><section id="case-fact-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>为本事项明确选择事实来源</h3><p>仅将本人合成断言用于这次服务资料准备。所有竞争来源保留，明确选择不证明真实性，也不作资格判断。</p><button id="case-fact-read" class="secondary">查看本事项事实来源与用途</button><p id="case-fact-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="case-fact-questions"></div><form id="case-fact-declare-form" hidden><label><input id="case-fact-declare-purpose" type="checkbox" required>为本事项开启地区、员工人数、服务诉求的资料准备用途核对；来源变化后重新明确确认</label><label>本次用途声明说明<textarea id="case-fact-declare-reason" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><button id="case-fact-declare">明确声明本次事实用途</button></form><form id="case-fact-confirm-form" hidden><div id="case-fact-fields"></div><label><input id="case-fact-purpose" type="checkbox" required>仅将逐项选择的事实用于本次服务资料准备，仍按原流程重新人工核对</label><label>本次来源选择说明<textarea id="case-fact-confirm-reason" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><button id="case-fact-confirm" disabled>明确记录本次用途与来源</button></form><button id="case-fact-retry" class="secondary" hidden>以原参数重试并核对本次事实操作结果</button><details id="case-fact-source-entry" hidden><summary>从本人原事实入口追加合成来源</summary><p>追加到本人共享事实来源，不替换旧断言。来源变化会使采用这些字段的旧事项用途确认失效；须逐项重新选择并人工核对。只接受合成自述，不核实真实性。</p><form id="case-fact-source-form"><label>字段<select id="case-fact-source-field"><option value="region">地区</option><option value="employees">员工人数</option><option value="service_need">服务诉求</option></select></label><label>新来源的自述值<input id="case-fact-source-value" maxlength="2000" required></label><label>来源编号<input id="case-fact-source-ref" maxlength="120" required></label><label>来源版本<input id="case-fact-source-version" maxlength="120" required></label><label>来源原文摘录<textarea id="case-fact-source-excerpt" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><label>生效时间（UTC ISO，例2026-10-07T00:00:00Z）<input id="case-fact-source-from" required></label><label>失效时间（UTC ISO）<input id="case-fact-source-until" required></label><label><input id="case-fact-source-purpose" type="checkbox" required>本人明确仅追加合成的服务资料准备来源，并核对上述有效期</label><button id="case-fact-source-save">明确追加本人合成来源</button></form></details><h4>本事项事实用途历史</h4><div id="case-fact-history"></div><p id="case-fact-error" role="alert"></p></section><section id="fact-bundle-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>本事项事实来源与人工锁</h3><p>企业自述、当前资料摘录、待核假设分开保存。仅本人按本次资料准备用途读取，来源仍未经核实；假设不能直接作为事实选择。来源换版保留历史，不会自动改动你锁定的选择。</p><button id="fb-read" type="button">读取本次来源包</button><button id="fb-recover" type="button">只读核对原来源操作</button><p id="fb-status" role="status"></p><form id="fb-form" hidden><label>来源类型<select id="fb-kind"><option value="REGISTER_DOCUMENT">当前资料的精确摘录</option><option value="REGISTER_ASSUMPTION">待核假设（不进入事实选择）</option></select></label><label>字段<select id="fb-field"><option value="region">地区</option><option value="employees">员工人数</option><option value="service_need">服务诉求</option></select></label><div id="fb-document-fields"><label>本事项当前资料<select id="fb-document"></select></label><label>当前资料全文<textarea id="fb-document-text" readonly rows="4"></textarea></label><label>从上方资料复制精确摘录<textarea id="fb-quote" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><label>相同摘录在资料中的第几处<input id="fb-occurrence" type="number" min="1" max="16" value="1"></label></div><label>字段值<input id="fb-value" maxlength="2000" required readonly></label><p id="fb-unit"></p><div id="fb-assumption-fields" hidden><label>为什么仅作为待核假设<textarea id="fb-note" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label></div><label>生效时间（UTC ISO）<input id="fb-from" required></label><label>失效时间（UTC ISO）<input id="fb-until" required></label><label><input id="fb-purpose" type="checkbox" required>仅为本事项登记来源或未知假设，不核实真实性、不对外分享</label><button id="fb-save" disabled>明确登记本次来源</button></form><label>本次登记、撤回、锁定或解锁说明<textarea id="fb-reason" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><div id="fb-locks"></div><div id="fb-entries"></div><details><summary>来源包历史</summary><div id="fb-history"></div></details><p id="fb-error" role="alert"></p></section>
+<p class="eyebrow">PREPARATION · 资料准备</p><h2>资料准备事项</h2><p id="prep-summary" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><section id="ordinary-runtime-entry" class="combination-panel"><h3>此事项的原运行与办理入口</h3><p>按当前资料记录的 Case、Run 和精确服务版本读取；各入口仍会核对当前权限。已有访问批准只用于原 Run READ，资源方案批准仍须原独立契约。</p><button id="runtime-run-read" type="button">只读查看此事项原 Run</button><button id="runtime-dispatch-read" type="button">进入此事项原分派与接单</button><button id="runtime-access-read" type="button">只读查看原 Run 访问批准</button><button id="runtime-catalog-read" type="button">读取精确目录与方案批准状态</button><p id="runtime-entry-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="runtime-catalog-result"></div><section id="resource-plan-approval-read-panel"><h3>资源方案批准 · 只读核对已有记录</h3><p>与 Run READ 访问批准分开核对。这里不创建或激活批准，也不提供资源执行权限。</p><button id="resource-plan-approval-read" type="button">读取已有资源方案批准</button><p id="resource-plan-approval-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="resource-plan-approval-result"></div><button id="resource-plan-approval-original" type="button" hidden>只读核对原批准记录</button></section></section><button id="prep-refresh">刷新当前事项</button><section id="case-cancel-panel" class="combination-panel"><h3>未提交回执前取消</h3><p>仅支持普通合成Case：首次接单前，或已接单且全部人工步骤从未提交回执。已有提交、核对、关闭或隔离效果均不能在此取消。取消停止新增资料、方案、分派、接单和回执；成功建单、原资料与实际接单历史保留。本片不支持取消后恢复。取消不释放预约，已有预约仍占容量，请按原资源权限独立释放。</p><button id="case-cancel-read" type="button" class="secondary">核对取消条件与原请求</button><button id="case-cancel-recover" type="button" class="secondary" hidden>只读核对原取消</button><p id="case-cancel-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="case-cancel-new-entry" hidden><h4>用新输入另建独立事项</h4><p>此旧Case仍为CANCELLED，原资料、接单历史、责任和资源占用保留。新Case须填写全新诉求与材料，另行采用方案、审批、核对容量及办理。已有资源仅可从原入口独立授权释放。</p><label><input id="case-cancel-new-confirm" type="checkbox">我确认前往原新事项入口，使用全新输入另建独立Case；不恢复旧Case，不带入原方案、审批或资源，也不自动释放占用。</label><button id="case-cancel-new-open" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>前往新事项输入入口</button></div><form id="case-cancel-form" hidden><label>明确取消原因<textarea id="case-cancel-reason" required maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><label><input id="case-cancel-confirm" type="checkbox">我确认取消此Case，并理解预约须独立释放且本片不支持恢复</label><button id="case-cancel-submit" type="submit" disabled>确认取消此Case</button></form></section><section id="case-reconcile-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>已有人工回执：取消请求与核对</h3><p>仅用于无外部效果的本地人工合成回执。请求后停止新的办理，原回执事实与预约保留；未明确结果继续核对中。全部原结果核实后仍须单独确认终结。取消不会释放预约，资源须按原权限独立办理。</p><button id="case-reconcile-read" type="button" class="secondary">读取当前取消与全部原回执</button><button id="case-reconcile-recover" type="button" class="secondary" hidden>只读核对原请求结果</button><p id="case-reconcile-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="case-reconcile-receipts"></div><form id="case-reconcile-form" hidden><label>本次明确操作原因<textarea id="case-reconcile-reason" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><label><input id="case-reconcile-confirm" type="checkbox" required>本人已核对当前Case及全部原资料；明确选择本次操作，保留原事实，资源另行释放</label><div class="actions"><button id="case-reconcile-request" type="button" disabled>明确请求取消，停止新办理</button><button id="case-reconcile-record" type="button" disabled>保存逐项核对结果</button><button id="case-reconcile-finish" type="button" disabled>全部结果核实后确认终结</button></div></form></section><section id="handling-deadline-panel" class="combination-panel"><h3>办理期限与来源</h3><p>核对当前事项的明确来源与逐日工作日历。缺少来源时保持待确认；当前没有业务停表权限。</p><button id="handling-deadline-read" type="button" class="secondary">只读核对办理期限</button><p id="handling-deadline-status" role="status">办理期限待确认。</p><div id="handling-deadline-result"></div><p id="handling-deadline-error" role="alert"></p></section><p id="prep-recovery-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="prep-recovery-read" class="secondary" hidden>只读核对此事项原提交记录</button><button id="prep-recovery-release" class="secondary" hidden>已查看当前材料，返回原流程</button><div id="prep-materials"></div><section id="material-draft-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>从已选事实整理诉求摘要</h3><p>将你为本事项明确选用的地区、员工人数和服务诉求整理成新的未核验材料，交给原获派专员检查。不会生成政策要求、证明或资格结论，也不会自动补齐材料目录。</p><button id="material-draft-read" type="button" class="secondary">查看当前来源的摘要草稿与待补材料</button><p id="material-draft-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="material-draft-content"></div><div id="material-draft-checklist"></div><form id="material-draft-form" hidden><label><input id="material-draft-share" type="checkbox" required>我已检查全文，明确将这三个所选自述值及来源版本/指纹作为本事项的新材料分享给下方原获派专员；仍须其独立核对</label><p id="material-draft-recipient"></p><button id="material-draft-save">明确追加此摘要为新未核验版本</button></form><p id="material-draft-error" role="alert"></p></section><section id="material-file-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>从文件整理材料候选</h3><p>选择本人有权使用的本地合成样例 TXT、MD、CSV 或 JSON。最多8KiB，整理后的正文最多4000字符；只读取你选择的文件，不提取事实或核实真实性，不调用模型。文件内容会发送到当前本机API解析，先看全文再决定是否填入原表单。</p><label>合成样例文件<input id="material-file-input" type="file" accept=".txt,.md,.csv,.json"></label><label><input id="material-file-synthetic" type="checkbox">这是我有权用于此事项的合成样例，内容不代表真实企业资料或业务证明</label><button id="material-file-read" type="button">读取文件并查看候选全文</button><p id="material-file-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="material-file-output" hidden><label>候选正文（尚未保存）<textarea id="material-file-text" rows="8" readonly></textarea></label><p id="material-file-source"></p><button id="material-file-use" type="button" disabled>填入下方原材料表单</button><p>填入后可以人工编辑。原文件指纹仅作来源线索，本次保存以原表单正文为准；仍须点击原“追加材料版本”，再由原获派专员核对、企业确认。</p></div></section><section id="material-version-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>追加前核对本次材料差异</h3><p>先在下方原表单选择材料类型、填写或导入正文及来源，再核对同事项当前同槽材料。编辑后须重新核对；不会自动采纳事实、保存材料或解决补正。</p><button id="material-version-compare" type="button" class="secondary">核对本表单与当前材料差异</button><p id="material-version-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="material-version-output" hidden></div></section><form id="prep-evidence"><label>材料类型<select id="prep-slot"><option value="need_summary">诉求摘要</option><option value="material_outline">材料目录</option></select></label><label>候选材料内容<textarea id="prep-text" maxlength="4000" required></textarea></label><p id="material-file-editing" role="status" hidden></p><label>来源类型<select id="prep-source-kind"><option value="USER_STATEMENT">企业自述</option><option value="DOCUMENT_EXCERPT">文档摘录（尚未核实真实性）</option></select></label><label>来源与文档版本<input id="prep-source-label" maxlength="200" required placeholder="例如：合成材料清单 v1 / 用户自述"></label><button>追加材料版本</button></form><section id="material-review-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>专员复核：相对最近一次审核的材料变化</h3><p>重新读取当前已存双槽材料，与最近一次原审核可精确绑定的材料对照。企业比较不替代本次人工审核；这里不判断补正充分、真实性或资格。</p><button id="material-review-read" type="button" class="secondary">只读核对上次审核与当前材料差异</button><p id="material-review-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="material-review-output" hidden></div></section><form id="prep-decision"><label>人工说明<textarea id="prep-reason" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><fieldset id="prep-correction-slots" hidden><legend>要求新版补正的材料</legend><label><input type="checkbox" data-correction-slot="need_summary">诉求摘要</label><label><input type="checkbox" data-correction-slot="material_outline">材料目录</label><p>所选材料须提交新版本后才能核对；未选择时只记录一般补正说明。</p></fieldset><div class="actions"><button id="prep-correction" type="button">要求补正</button><button id="prep-review" type="button">核对本地资料包</button><button id="prep-confirm" type="button">确认本地资料准备</button><button id="prep-reopen" type="button">申请重开资料准备</button></div></form><p>核对仅表示获派专员检查当前资料包，不证明资料真实性或资格满足。确认只推进本地资料准备；Case目标、外部受理和线下履约不自动完成。</p><button id="service-plan-prepare" class="secondary">查看此Case持久步骤计划</button><button id="plan-prepare" class="secondary">查看此事项四步计划</button><button id="local-case-prepare" class="secondary">查看此Case的本地关闭与重开记录</button><button id="dispatch-prepare" class="secondary">查看此事项的内部分派</button><button id="receipt-prepare" class="secondary" hidden>查看此运行已有获派执行者</button><form id="receipt-create" hidden><label>当前合法获派执行者<select id="receipt-executor" required></select></label><button>建立合成回执步骤</button></form><div class="combination-panel"><h3>此服务Case的资源关联</h3><p>选择本人已确认的组合，持久记录资料版本、资源归属和核对说明。关联不新增占用，不代表真实预约或履约；资料重开或资源变化须重新核对。</p><button id="case-resource-load" class="secondary" hidden>查看此Case资源并选择关联</button><div id="case-resource-panel" hidden><p id="case-resource-summary" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><form id="case-resource-form"><label>有权使用的资源组合<select id="case-resource-choice" required></select></label><label>关联或重新核对说明<textarea id="case-resource-reason" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><button>确认此Case资源关联</button></form><p class="notice">一个组合只归属一个Case。换组合或重开资料不会取消旧预约；到资源工作区显式整组取消，原关联历史保留。</p><div id="case-resource-history"></div></div><p id="case-resource-error" role="alert"></p></div><article id="simulation-rule-panel"><h3>合成规则准备度（开发模拟）</h3><p>仅定位服务端已配置的开发绑定。SYNTHETIC_REVIEWED只表示合成模拟事件链，不能代替正式审核或真实事实核验。资格始终未判定。</p><label>已有开发绑定编号<input id="simulation-binding" maxlength="100"></label><label>明确评估时点（UTC）<input id="simulation-as-of" type="datetime-local"></label><button id="simulation-rule-read" type="button" class="secondary">只读核对合成规则准备度</button><p id="simulation-rule-status" role="status"></p><div id="simulation-rule-result"></div></article><article id="case-time-panel"><h3>本人同资源替代时段</h3><p>先读取本事项当前办理计划和原资源关联，再查同一组资源的时段。提议不释放旧占用；分别预检、占位、组合确认、Case比较与重核仍须原入口明确操作。</p><label>搜索起点（UTC）<input id="case-time-from" type="datetime-local"></label><label>搜索终点（UTC，窗口不超过24小时）<input id="case-time-until" type="datetime-local"></label><button id="case-time-read" type="button" class="secondary">只读查找本人同资源替代时段</button><p id="case-time-status" role="status"></p><div id="case-time-result"></div><h4>仅GET核对原资源请求</h4><label>原请求类型<select id="case-resource-recovery-kind"><option value="HOLD">单资源占位/确认/释放</option><option value="COMBINATION">两资源组合确认/取消</option><option value="LINK">本事项资源关联</option></select></label><label>原请求键<input id="case-resource-recovery-key" maxlength="100"></label><label>原正文指纹（可选，精确64位SHA256）<input id="case-resource-recovery-fingerprint" maxlength="64"></label><button id="case-resource-recovery-read" type="button" class="secondary">只读核对这个原请求键</button><div id="case-resource-recovery-result"></div></article><div id="readiness-panel" class="combination-panel"><h3>此事项材料准备度</h3><p id="readiness-summary" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p>只核对本地合成资料条件。材料真实性未核实；规则处于工程草稿、未业务发布，资格仍未知，Case目标未完成。</p><button id="readiness-assess">保存当前材料准备度评估</button><section id="material-pack-panel"><h4>当前材料准备与补正文本包</h4><p>整理已分享的当前材料、缺口和原补正说明，供你复制或保存。每次输出重新核对权限与版本；正式政策和真实履约仍待核实。</p><button id="material-pack-generate" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>生成当前材料文本包</button><p id="material-pack-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="material-pack-output" hidden><label>本次读取快照<textarea id="material-pack-text" rows="12" readonly></textarea></label><button id="material-pack-copy" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>重新核对并复制</button><button id="material-pack-download" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>重新核对并下载文本</button></div></section><div id="readiness-checklist"></div><div id="readiness-conditions"></div><details><summary>可复核来源与规则</summary><div id="readiness-sources"></div></details><details><summary>历史评估（过期结论不能用于当前资料）</summary><div id="readiness-history"></div></details><p id="readiness-error" role="alert"></p></div><section id="case-fact-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>为本事项明确选择事实来源</h3><p>仅将本人合成断言用于这次服务资料准备。所有竞争来源保留，明确选择不证明真实性，也不作资格判断。</p><button id="case-fact-read" class="secondary">查看本事项事实来源与用途</button><p id="case-fact-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="case-fact-questions"></div><form id="case-fact-declare-form" hidden><label><input id="case-fact-declare-purpose" type="checkbox" required>为本事项开启地区、员工人数、服务诉求的资料准备用途核对；来源变化后重新明确确认</label><label>本次用途声明说明<textarea id="case-fact-declare-reason" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><button id="case-fact-declare">明确声明本次事实用途</button></form><form id="case-fact-confirm-form" hidden><div id="case-fact-fields"></div><label><input id="case-fact-purpose" type="checkbox" required>仅将逐项选择的事实用于本次服务资料准备，仍按原流程重新人工核对</label><label>本次来源选择说明<textarea id="case-fact-confirm-reason" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><button id="case-fact-confirm" disabled>明确记录本次用途与来源</button></form><button id="case-fact-retry" class="secondary" hidden>以原参数重试并核对本次事实操作结果</button><details id="case-fact-source-entry" hidden><summary>从本人原事实入口追加合成来源</summary><p>追加到本人共享事实来源，不替换旧断言。来源变化会使采用这些字段的旧事项用途确认失效；须逐项重新选择并人工核对。只接受合成自述，不核实真实性。</p><form id="case-fact-source-form"><label>字段<select id="case-fact-source-field"><option value="region">地区</option><option value="employees">员工人数</option><option value="service_need">服务诉求</option></select></label><label>新来源的自述值<input id="case-fact-source-value" maxlength="2000" required></label><label>来源编号<input id="case-fact-source-ref" maxlength="120" required></label><label>来源版本<input id="case-fact-source-version" maxlength="120" required></label><label>来源原文摘录<textarea id="case-fact-source-excerpt" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><label>生效时间（UTC ISO，例2026-10-07T00:00:00Z）<input id="case-fact-source-from" required></label><label>失效时间（UTC ISO）<input id="case-fact-source-until" required></label><label><input id="case-fact-source-purpose" type="checkbox" required>本人明确仅追加合成的服务资料准备来源，并核对上述有效期</label><button id="case-fact-source-save">明确追加本人合成来源</button></form></details><h4>本事项事实用途历史</h4><div id="case-fact-history"></div><p id="case-fact-error" role="alert"></p></section><section id="fact-bundle-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>本事项事实来源与人工锁</h3><p>企业自述、当前资料摘录、待核假设分开保存。仅本人按本次资料准备用途读取，来源仍未经核实；假设不能直接作为事实选择。来源换版保留历史，不会自动改动你锁定的选择。</p><button id="fb-read" type="button">读取本次来源包</button><button id="fb-recover" type="button">只读核对原来源操作</button><p id="fb-status" role="status"></p><form id="fb-form" hidden><label>来源类型<select id="fb-kind"><option value="REGISTER_DOCUMENT">当前资料的精确摘录</option><option value="REGISTER_ASSUMPTION">待核假设（不进入事实选择）</option></select></label><label>字段<select id="fb-field"><option value="region">地区</option><option value="employees">员工人数</option><option value="service_need">服务诉求</option></select></label><div id="fb-document-fields"><label>本事项当前资料<select id="fb-document"></select></label><label>当前资料全文<textarea id="fb-document-text" readonly rows="4"></textarea></label><label>从上方资料复制精确摘录<textarea id="fb-quote" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><label>相同摘录在资料中的第几处<input id="fb-occurrence" type="number" min="1" max="16" value="1"></label></div><label>字段值<input id="fb-value" maxlength="2000" required readonly></label><p id="fb-unit"></p><div id="fb-assumption-fields" hidden><label>为什么仅作为待核假设<textarea id="fb-note" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label></div><label>生效时间（UTC ISO）<input id="fb-from" required></label><label>失效时间（UTC ISO）<input id="fb-until" required></label><label><input id="fb-purpose" type="checkbox" required>仅为本事项登记来源或未知假设，不核实真实性、不对外分享</label><button id="fb-save" disabled>明确登记本次来源</button></form><label>本次登记、撤回、锁定或解锁说明<textarea id="fb-reason" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><div id="fb-locks"></div><div id="fb-entries"></div><details><summary>来源包历史</summary><div id="fb-history"></div></details><p id="fb-error" role="alert"></p></section>
 <section id="material-reuse-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>同用途复用本人材料目录</h3><p>为此新事项明确选择本人同一服务的已核对材料目录。复制后作为新的未核验版本，仍须提交本次诉求摘要并由本事项专员重新核对。</p><button id="material-reuse-read" class="secondary">查看本人可复用材料及历史</button><p id="material-reuse-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><form id="material-reuse-form" hidden><label>本人来源材料<select id="material-reuse-source" required></select></label><button id="material-reuse-preview" type="button" class="secondary">查看所选材料内容与版本</button><div id="material-reuse-selected"></div><label><input id="material-reuse-purpose" type="checkbox" required>仅将这份材料目录用于同一服务的本次新Case，并重新提交独立核对</label><label>本次复用说明<textarea id="material-reuse-reason" maxlength="1000" required></textarea></label><button id="material-reuse-confirm" disabled>明确复制为本次未核验材料</button></form><button id="material-reuse-retry" class="secondary" hidden>仅使用原操作核对复用结果</button><h4>本事项复用来源记录</h4><div id="material-reuse-history"></div><p id="material-reuse-error" role="alert"></p></section><section id="material-corrections-panel" class="combination-panel"><h3>逐项补正与当前材料版本</h3><p id="material-corrections-summary" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="material-corrections-current"></div><details><summary>补正请求与核对历史</summary><div id="material-corrections-history"></div></details><p id="material-corrections-error" role="alert"></p></section><p id="prep-command-feedback" class="notice" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="prep-command-retry" class="secondary" hidden>以原参数核对此次未知结果</button><section id="opportunity-panel" class="combination-panel" hidden><h3>本事项合成机会</h3><p>手动导入本人事项的资料变化或既有合成服务版本提示，仍须人工审阅；不判断政策资格，不自动外发，不代表后台持续在线。</p><button id="opp-read" type="button">读取当前机会与来源</button><button id="opp-recover" type="button">只读核对原机会操作</button><p id="opp-status" role="status"></p><label>本次导入、刷新、忽略或撤回说明<textarea id="opp-reason" maxlength="1000"></textarea></label><button id="opp-refresh" type="button" disabled>明确手动刷新来源绑定</button><details><summary>明确导入合成机会</summary><form id="o